#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:7
#: b2421210e88a4feda4ed5dd617c9d5fd
msgid "Loading Firmware via SD Card"
msgstr "通过 SD 卡加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:9
#: c3a877d78794475ab398efc4493ac37c
msgid ""
"It is possible to update the ArduPilot firmware on certain autopilots by "
"placing a specifically-named file onto an SD card and running the "
"autopilot's bootloader (e.g. by power-cycling the board)."
msgstr "在某些飞控上，可以通过将特定名称的文件放入 SD 卡并运行引导程序（例如重新上电）来更新 ArduPilot 固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:11
#: 8c93c14c5add483a9cda2405d7b11746
msgid ""
"at this time only a few autopilots have this capability. See instructions "
"below to determine if an autopilot has this feature. Only H7 based "
"autopilots using MMC connected SD cards are capable of this and not all that"
" do have had the feature added as of yet."
msgstr ""
"目前仅少数飞控具备此功能。请参阅以下说明确认飞控是否支持。只有使用 MMC 连接 SD 卡的 H7 "
"飞控才具备此能力，且并非所有支持的飞控都已添加此功能。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:14
#: f9662026f19549a685079b133612271e
msgid "Why would I want to do this?"
msgstr "我为什么需要这个功能？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:15
#: 53b383b27c124f5dbee34b1112b884b8
msgid "There are several reasons this technique may be of use:"
msgstr "此技术在以下几种情况下可能有用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:17
#: 1d6a5ccae9f74d50923ab8d225da8bf6
msgid "There is no convenient, reliable access to the vehicle's USB port"
msgstr "飞行器的 USB 接口不方便或无法可靠访问"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:18
#: 3bd5d83c43a541b08f2c0213a57b1d38
msgid "It is desired to update the vehicle firmware over a telemetry radio"
msgstr "希望通过数传电台更新飞行器固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:19
#: 5af21554535749839e6f239fabd8e40a
msgid ""
"The vehicle is remote and the local operators may struggle with the normal "
"interfaces to update the firmware. This allows OEMs to remotely add an "
"updated file onto users' SD cards which would upload on the next boot of the"
" vehicle."
msgstr ""
"飞行器位于偏远地区，现场操作人员可能无法通过常规接口更新固件。这允许 OEM 厂商远程将更新文件放入用户的 SD 卡，在飞行器下次启动时自动烧写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:22
#: e349c43db0c54a9886b3e3415154bf92
msgid "Is my autopilot capable of this?"
msgstr "我的飞控是否支持此功能？"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:23
#: 3e98267500be4e5f8f700d0fb619bfb3
msgid "In order to do this several elements must be present:"
msgstr "要支持此功能，需要具备以下几个条件："

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:25
#: c2c111c2790445879cc31a1bfa2ccb07
msgid "The autopilot must have SD card capability"
msgstr "飞控必须具备 SD 卡功能"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:26
#: 21540058aac24e44a1ba5f40ef667739
msgid "The SD card must be enabled in its bootloader"
msgstr "SD 卡必须在引导程序中启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:27
#: 218c44a362e54282a2a6d769a5d98af0
msgid ""
"The bootloader code and flashing firmware must be enabled in the autopilots "
"firmware definition files (hwdefs)"
msgstr "引导程序代码和烧写固件功能必须在飞控固件定义文件（hwdefs）中启用"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:29
#: 01aa8ebf3d0542b19db4dc1131e11a6f
msgid ""
"To see if a given autopilot has this capability, you can check in its "
"firmware folder on the `Firmware build server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ to see if it has a ``xxxxxx.abin`` file "
"present."
msgstr ""
"要检查特定飞控是否具备此功能，可在 `固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ "
"上的飞控固件目录中查找是否存在 ``xxxxxx.abin`` 文件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:32
#: 30715d40b49340358067529839dd080f
msgid "The Bootloader"
msgstr "引导程序"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:33
#: 68db8a52a6124c7e9ab31f9391f23bb5
msgid ""
"A bootloader capable of flashing from the SD card is required (and the "
"autopilot must have SD card capability, obviously). Newer autopilot's with "
"SD cards may or may not have this capability and a capable bootloader "
"included in their hardware definition (if not, see :ref:`Building capable "
"firmware yourself <building-autoflash-firmware>`)."
msgstr ""
"需要支持从 SD 卡烧写的引导程序（且飞控必须具备 SD 卡功能）。较新的带 SD 卡的飞控可能包含也可能不包含此功能和对应的引导程序（如未包含，请参阅"
" :ref:`自行编译支持的固件 <building-autoflash-firmware>`）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:35
#: 307d869653804f3cb15b4058b72d9cde
msgid ""
"If the autopilot firmware currently provides this capability, updating your "
"current bootloader may be required to support flashing from SD card.  Note "
"that updating the autopilot's bootloader is an operation which can make your"
" board non-operational, and difficult to recover.  More-so with boards that "
"do not expose a \"boot0\" pin, such as the CubeOrange.  Be aware of this "
"risk, and be prepared to spend considerable time recovering a board if "
"something bad happens when updating the bootloader."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控固件目前提供此功能，可能需要更新引导程序才能支持从 SD "
"卡烧写。请注意，更新飞控引导程序是一项可能导致主板无法工作的操作，且难以恢复。对于未暴露「boot0」引脚的主板（如 "
"CubeOrange）尤为如此。请充分了解此风险，并做好在引导程序更新出错时花费大量时间恢复主板的准备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:37
#: 402dc207c1dc4658ba00ac76ccf2165e
msgid ""
":ref:`The instructions on updating the bootloader <common-bootloader-"
"update>` can be followed to update your bootloader; be aware that you must "
"use a recent firmware (4.5 or higher) to obtain a suitable bootloader."
msgstr ""
":ref:`更新引导程序的说明 <common-bootloader-update>` 可供参考；请注意必须使用较新的固件（4.5 "
"或更高版本）才能获取合适的引导程序。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:40
#: 08ce452d35f840279011b38132016870
msgid "The Firmware File"
msgstr "固件文件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:41
#: 4801a199949349288a69ca9e813a0c17
msgid ""
"The file to be loaded onto the SD card is of a specially named "
"\"xxxxx.abin\" file created for this purpose.  This is a binary file with a "
"small amount of text providing some information about the binary. Most "
"notably, a checksum which the bootloader will verify before attempting to "
"flash the board."
msgstr ""
"需要放到 SD "
"卡上的文件是专门为此目的创建的特定名称「xxxxx.abin」文件，这是一个包含少量文本信息的二进制文件，其中包含校验和，引导程序在尝试烧写主板前会进行验证。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:43
#: fa43fa34a7d64047a9ad753cc80c5362
msgid ""
"Boards which support flash-from-sdcard will also have ``.abin`` files "
"available for download from the `Firmware build server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__."
msgstr ""
"支持从 SD 卡烧写的主板，在 `固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 上也提供 ``.abin`` "
"文件下载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:46
#: f76237b168a74759894c4bc2a7c92f1c
msgid "Firmware File Name"
msgstr "固件文件名"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:47
#: 7939fad5c5be4feaa1619056de506ffe
msgid ""
"The filename which is used when generating firmware is ***not*** the correct"
" name to use when placing the firmware on the SD card.  When the ``.abin`` "
"files are generated they contain the vehicle name, for example, "
"\"arduplane.abin\"."
msgstr ""
"生成固件时使用的文件名***不是***放置到 SD 卡时应使用的正确名称。生成的 ``.abin`` "
"文件包含飞行器名称，例如「arduplane.abin」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:49
#: f9996c5f59f945139024f40a232ff3b2
msgid ""
"There is only one correct filename that may be used to flash-from-sdcard; "
"this is ``ardupilot.abin``.  When placing the file on the SD card, ensure "
"the file has been renamed to ``ardupilot.abin``."
msgstr ""
"从 SD 卡烧写只有一个正确的文件名，即 ``ardupilot.abin``。将文件放置到 SD 卡时，确保将文件重命名为 "
"``ardupilot.abin``。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:52
#: c3fecabfc68a4c15a6049d81e5afaffe
msgid "Transferring the File to the SD card"
msgstr "将文件传输到 SD 卡"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:53
#: cf353875fd7943c9beadc7524caefc09
msgid ""
"This can be done in your operating system as you would ordinarily interact "
"with the SD card (e.g. file browser)."
msgstr "可以在操作系统中像平时操作 SD 卡一样完成（例如通过文件浏览器）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:55
#: 1a38171b9d704e7dba0a30b68478e6b2
msgid ""
"You can also transfer the file to the SD card's base directory via "
"``MAVFTP`` using Mission Planner or similar GCS"
msgstr "也可以通过Mission Planner或类似地面站，使用 ``MAVFTP`` 将文件传输到 SD 卡根目录。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:60
#: 98f02cb2c23e40159b85978cc86600d2
msgid "Ensure the file is the correct size before continuing."
msgstr "继续前请确认文件大小正确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:62
#: aa9048f4a46c4ac996714ddfec78213a
msgid ""
"After the transfer is complete, the directory listing should look something "
"like this:"
msgstr "传输完成后，目录列表应类似如下所示："

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:76
#: de78bc448b764d12aff58f9ef926d278
msgid "Triggering the Flash Update"
msgstr "触发烧写更新"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:77
#: 7acd1b7d42534bc19b00c6e6eb09e335
msgid ""
"Power cycle the board to enter the bootloader which will automatically check"
" for the firmware update file and begin flashing it.  Alternatively to avoid"
" the powercycle the autopilot may be rebooted via a "
"`PREFLIGHT_REBOOT_SHUTDOWN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_PREFLIGHT_REBOOT_SHUTDOWN>`__"
" command with the 'Param1' field set to 3 (ie. \"Reboot autopilot and keep "
"it in the bootloader until upgraded\")"
msgstr ""
"重新上电进入引导程序，引导程序将自动检查固件更新文件并开始烧写。或者，为避免重新上电，也可以通过 `PREFLIGHT_REBOOT_SHUTDOWN "
"<https://mavlink.io/en/messages/common.html#MAV_CMD_PREFLIGHT_REBOOT_SHUTDOWN>`__"
" 命令重启飞控，将「Param1」字段设置为 3（即「重启飞控并保持在引导程序中直到升级完成」）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:79
#: 7e9792301b924cf9b9e7291c837283e5
msgid ""
"It should take roughly 1 minute to verify the firmware and flash it to the "
"vehicle's internal flash."
msgstr "验证固件并烧写到飞行器内部闪存大约需要 1 分钟。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:81
#: d9bcedc58ccb47fcbe9d1d72951f5dc5
msgid ""
"If the process completes successfully the file will renamed to ``ardupilot-"
"flashed.abin``.  The vehicle should proceed to boot the firmware once "
"flashing is complete."
msgstr "若流程成功完成，文件将被重命名为 ``ardupilot-flashed.abin``。烧写完成后，飞行器应继续启动固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:84
#: 602dc01516c847c7af7a3acc5da35ef0
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr "故障排除"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:85
#: 10a7e3cf2caa45e7b458018c4e88d2a5
msgid ""
"Several things can go wrong with the firmware flash, but some diagnostics "
"are available to help work out what the problem might be."
msgstr "固件烧写过程中可能出现多种问题，以下诊断信息可帮助判断问题原因。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:87
#: 45552aa4ee5d455b85539ba01151010a
msgid ""
"At each stage of the flashing process, the ``ardupilot.abin`` file is "
"renamed to reflect the stage"
msgstr "在烧写流程的每个阶段，``ardupilot.abin`` 文件会被重命名以反映当前阶段"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:88
#: 45898a5cb36e4b92beeaeb4091fd1176
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-verify.abin`` then the process failed when"
" trying to checksum the file, or the board was interrupted when doing so."
msgstr "若文件名为 ``ardupilot-verify.abin``，则流程在校验文件校验和时失败，或在校验过程中被中断"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:89
#: 2fedf324c7ae4d5491ddea8e95867c02
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-verify-failed.abin`` then the checksum the"
" bootloader calculated did not match the bootloader in the ``.abin`` "
"metadata."
msgstr ""
"若文件名为 ``ardupilot-verify-failed.abin``，则引导程序计算的校验和与 ``.abin`` 元数据中的校验和不匹配"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:90
#: fe87c95abb1e4b90993633be2edad1d2
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-flash.abin`` the process failed when "
"writing the firmware, or the board was interrupted while doing so.  The "
"board is unlikely to boot into an ArduPilot firmware if this has happened, "
"so a re-flash will be required."
msgstr ""
"若文件名为 ``ardupilot-flash.abin``，则固件写入过程失败，或在写入时被中断。若发生这种情况，主板很可能无法启动 "
"ArduPilot 固件，需要重新烧写。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:91
#: 8610a1454a5b4accb42b930435b6749a
msgid ""
"if the file is called ``ardupilot-flashed.abin`` you should not need this "
"\"troubleshooting\" section, as the flash process has succeeded!"
msgstr "若文件名为 ``ardupilot-flashed.abin``，则无需查看本「故障排除」章节，烧写流程已成功完成！"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:96
#: 5632d3762f6c415fae44a9b228bb3fbd
msgid "Building the firmware yourself"
msgstr "自行编译固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:98
#: 7743d14461af442fb6875a26e5e77119
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has an SD card capability but no SD Card flash-able "
"firmware is present on the `Firmware build server "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__, you can build the firmware yourself. "
"You must setup a build environment and then modify the autopilot's hwdefs to"
" build a capable bootloader and an ``xxxx.abin`` firmware, see "
":ref:`building-the-code`."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控具备 SD 卡功能，但 `固件构建服务器 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`__ 上没有可从 SD "
"卡烧写的固件，您可以自行编译固件。需要搭建编译环境，然后修改飞控的 hwdefs 以编译支持的引导程序和 ``xxxx.abin`` 固件，请参阅 "
":ref:`building-the-code`。"

