"Also you must include the SD card setup. See the `MatekH743 autopilot "
"definition "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/MatekH743/hwdef-"
"bl.dat>`__ for an example."
msgstr ""
"同时必须包含 SD 卡设置。参阅 `MatekH743 飞控定义 "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_HAL_ChibiOS/hwdef/MatekH743/hwdef-"
"bl.dat>`__ 作为示例。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-install-sdcard.rst:119
#: a0a65cd68e3d4b18b4f22665f429bf92
msgid "In the ``hwdef.dat`` file you must include this:"
msgstr "在 ``hwdef.dat`` 文件中必须包含以下内容："

